# VESPER HALL CELLAR -- wine cellar under the study
# Tileset: TILESET_MANSION, brown parquet only; render it with a NITE palette
# when implemented. 9x6 blocks, buffer 180/1300.
# Stairs 16 (both steps) go back up to the study's hidden stair 15.
# Wall racks are the 11/18 bookshelf blocks, casks/racks are the 10 tables.
# MEDIUMs hold a seance here; the cask "vintage of the eclipse year" (sign)
# holds a second copy of the portrait clue for players who skipped the diary.
# Gap: no barrels or dark stone walls in this tileset.
ref CeladonMansion1F
tileset mansion
key .=03 W=04 O=10 P=11 s=16 K=18 v=08 p=09
grid:
sPKPKPKWp
.........
.OO.O.OO.
.........
.OO.O.OO.
.........
end
exit STAIRS 0 0
exit STAIRS2 1 0
obj trainer 6 3 MediumAgnes right 4
obj trainer 13 7 MediumEdith left 3
obj sign 9 4 EclipseVintage
obj item 16 10 RareCandy
obj sign 2 9 CaskRack
